  answer: Sam Butera & The Witnesses
  acceptedAnswers:
  - Sam Butera & The Witnesses
  hints:
  - "Su cat\xE1logo registrado incluye \xABBasin Street Blues/When It's Sleepy Time
    Down South - Medley / Remastered\xBB, de 1956, y llega hasta 1991."
  - "\xABBuona Sera - Remastered 2002\xBB presenta una energ\xEDa media y un pulso
    cercano a 128 BPM."
  - "Entre sus grabaciones figuran \xABJump, Jive, An' Wail - Remastered\xBB y \xABBanana
    Split For My Baby - Remastered\xBB."
  - "Tambi\xE9n lanz\xF3 \xABWhen You're Smiling/The Sheik Of Araby\xBB."
  - "Es el proyecto musical detr\xE1s de \xABPennies From Heaven\xBB y \xABJust A
    Gigolo / I Ain't Got Nobody - Medley / Remastered\xBB."
